Three is as many as you can expect in that situation; the number
attempted to be created is d(XL/3), where XL is the character's level,
with a minimum of one. However, the spell is always cast at you, so
there should have been a message along the lines of "Monsters appear
from nowhere!". Moreover, titanotheres aren't summonable nasties
(baluchitheria are). I'd be more inclined to suspect a polymorph trap
on the level, if you're deep enough.

